    "['pw-template [parameter1]', [{'para_map': [], 'trans_command': 'l2vpn xconnect context pwt', 'parent_command': [], 'root': 'l2vpn xconnect context pwt', 'source': 'llm', 'origin_reponse': \"##\\nl2vpn xconnect context pwt\\n##\\n\\nThe Cisco equivalent of Huawei's `pw-template pwt` is `l2vpn xconnect context pwt`, which creates an L2VPN cross-connect context (similar to a pseudowire template) in Cisco IOS.\", 'trans_template': 'l2vpn xconnect context pwt'}]]": 1,
